  "details": "As far as I'm aware, there currently is no way to see camera dolly paths from other users which makes collaboration on complex shots with other people very difficult without watching the camera itself fly through a few times first, as well as just being a privacy concern. \n\nI just would really like *some* method for seeing other people's camera paths, whether it be a setting for swapping between seeing all paths or only friends' paths, or that they only show up when the quick menu is open, or some other implementation. I don't have a preferred implementation in mind.",
